WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.860
Companies: customers' company accounts: company details, document verification, credit, price tier and contacts.

2
00:00:10.408 --> 00:00:16.750
Click "New account" or open a request that came in by DM, and complete the "Company details".

3
00:00:17.299 --> 00:00:23.250
If a document is missing, "Ask for documents"; when complete, click "Verify".

4
00:00:23.798 --> 00:00:28.150
Set the "Price tier" and "Credit", then click "Save credit".

5
00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:34.100
Under "Contacts", link the company's people to their chats with "Add contact".

6
00:00:34.654 --> 00:00:41.730
Don't give credit to an unverified account; if the company's licence expires, it's flagged beside the account.
